## 🔁 Flashcard Component System – v0.1

### ✅ Completed:
- Core `<Flashcard />` component
- 3D flip effect (Y-axis rotation)
- Flicker-free animation using:
  - `backface-visibility: hidden`
  - opacity coordination (`opacity-0` / `opacity-100`)
  - GPU hint via `will-change: transform`
- Tailwind custom utilities for:
  - `.perspective`
  - `.preserve-3d`
  - `.rotate-y-180`
  - `.backface-hidden`
- Fully responsive layout ready for grid rendering

### 🧪 Tested:
- Flip works on click
- No overlapping or ghost flicker
- First-click and subsequent state transitions smooth
- Works in both light and dark themes

